BEGIN_PGML
On a number line, [`\sqrt{13}`] would be placed between which two consecutive integers (whole numbers)? (Provide two consecutive integers (whole numbers).)

[_]{$less}{10}[`\newcommand{\lt}{<}\lt \sqrt{13} \lt `][_]{$great}{10}

END_PGML

